{
  "$schema": "../../specs/erc7730-v2.schema.json",
  "_curation_note": "PQSigner semantic curation: all four formats are admitted for the seventeen fixed Ethereum ValidatorShareProxy deployments below. At Ethereum block 25630720 every proxy returned the same Blockscout-verified ValidatorShare implementation, whose verified source and runtime bind these route semantics. Every signed calldata operand is always visible. buyVoucherPOL treats _amount as a maximum because share rounding can reduce the POL actually deposited and also claims accrued rewards. sellVoucher_newPOL queues the signed claimAmount and caps burned shares, also claims accrued rewards, and its eventual claim uses the live withdrawal exchange rate. Claim and reward amounts come from caller-bound live state and are paid to the caller. Evidence is historical fixed-block authority, not future implementation/runtime, validator status, rates, rewards, unbond state, or execution-success authority.",
